Author: Alan Agius <alanagius@google.com>
Date:   Tue Apr 16 08:22:14 2024 +0000

    exclude caching for authenticated HTTP requests (#55034)

This update modifies the transfer cache logic to prevent caching of HTTP requests that require authorization. To opt-out from this behaviour use the `includeRequestsWithAuthHeaders` option in `withHttpTransferCache`

 By default we now prevent caching of HTTP requests that require authorization . To opt-out from this behaviour use the `includeRequestsWithAuthHeaders` option in `withHttpTransferCache`.

Example:
```ts
withHttpTransferCache({
  includeRequestsWithAuthHeaders: true,
})
```

Closes: #54745

