commit 2b9a8507896a2dd1a13187c2b10f6f535cb8c001
Author: Kristiyan Kostadinov <crisbeto@abv.bg>
Date:   Thu Dec 28 11:19:32 2023 +0200

    allow effect to be used inside an ErrorHandler (#53713)

`effect` was expecting an `ErrorHandler` in its constructor which can lead to a circular DI error if an effect is used inside a custom `ErrorHandler`. These changes inject the `ErrorHandler` only when reporting errors.

Fixes #52680.

PR Close #53713    
    PR Close #53713

